This asset pack is consumed at runtime by `scripts/iso/iso_atlas_builder.gd`.
The expected layout after extracting the official `microFantasy.v0.4.zip`:

    microfantasy/
    ├── iso/
    │   ├── iso_tileset.png        # main 18x20 iso tile grid, 16x8 per cell
    │   └── ...
    ├── characters/
    │   ├── knight_blue.png
    │   ├── barbarian.png
    │   └── ...
    └── items/
        └── ...

If the asset is missing, the system falls back to the procedural generator
defined in `_ProceduralAtlasGenerator` and the player keeps using the teal
sprite from `practice_iso_tiles_original.png`.

